 
🪔 An interactive love story that ends with a Diwali night of fireworks 🎆

 

    

🌐 Live Demo  •  ✨ Features  •  🚀 Run Locally  •  ✏️ Customize



🌸 About
A small web experience made with a lot of love. It walks through a story of memories with photos and heartfelt messages, asks one important question, and then lights up with a Diwali blessing and a glowing anar night scene with fireworks.

🎧 Best experienced with sound on. Open the link on a phone or laptop and tap once to start the music.

🔗 Live Link
👉 sorry31.netlify.app 👈

💫 The Journey
Step
Screen
What happens
1
📸 Memories
Photos with messages, move with Previous and Next
2
💌 The Question
A heartfelt Yes / No question
3
🎉 Celebration
A happy ending with a Diwali button
4
🪔 Diwali Blessing
Wishes appear one by one on a glowing, decorated card
5
🎆 Blow the Firecracker
A night sky, a burning fuse, a glowing anar and fireworks


✨ Features




🎶 Background Music
Starts on the first tap, with a button in the bottom-right corner to mute or unmute.
📸 Memory Story
Photo and message cards with smooth Previous / Next navigation.
💗 Floating Magic
Hearts, teddies, candies and sparkles drift across the background.




🪔 Diwali Blessing
A warm card with twinkling lights, floating diyas and sparkles, and a gold glowing heading. Each wish fades in after a calm pause so it can be read.
🎆 Anar and Fireworks
Built with HTML Canvas: a fountain of sparks, colour-changing bursts and heart-shaped fireworks. Tap anywhere to launch your own.

🛠️ Tech Stack
Technology
Used for
